(FALSE, NULL, 'I have realized that the...', 'Alan Watts', 'Time', 'en', 'I have realized that the past and future are real illusions, that they exist in the present, which is what there is and all there is.', 26, 133, 'MEDIUM', NOW(), NOW()),
